    <chapter title="Test Scenarios">
        <procedure title="Opens Audit Trails Menus" id="test-1">
            <p>Ensures the Audit Trail menu expands and contains the expected number of submenu items.</p>
            <p><b>Priority:</b> Medium</p>
            <step>Visit /main/dashboard.</step>
            <step>Expand the Administration menu and click the 4th item (Audit Trails).</step>
            <step>Alias the Audit Trails submenu for later reference.</step>
            <chapter title="Expected Results">
                <p>• The submenu is visible and contains exactly routes.length items.</p>
            </chapter>
        </procedure>
